# Theme definitions by nature (the values the tokens are made of, not rules that should read a token):
# book-tokens.css is the app copy of the design book's palette (docs/design/design-book/tokens.css);
# themes/derive.ts builds a theme's roles from its colours (white, black, the glass highlight);
# themes/nunchiro.ts writes the two bundled themes' palettes; themes/ghostty.ts, themes/catalog parse and list palettes.
